meta {
  name: Get Patient Dues
  type: http
  seq: 16
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/orders/patient-dues?patientId={{patientId}}
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  patientId: {{patientId}}
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{businessAccessToken}}
}

docs {
  Returns the patient's outstanding **previous dues** **business-wide** (every
  branch in the tenant) — `{ outstanding }`, the summed positive
  `netAmount − paidAmount` balance across their active, non-cancelled orders
  (`ORDER`/`APPOINTMENT`). Used by the Create Order screen (/registration/create)
  as the "Clear Previous Dues" maximum and to pre-validate the branch's
  Previous-Dues rules (Registration Settings → Charges & Reductions).

  Tenant-wide (NOT branch-scoped) so the value equals the patient's true total
  dues to the business — the same figure the cap, the previous-dues gate, the
  overpayment guard, and the oldest-first settlement all use. The tenant comes
  from the JWT. 422 `ORDER_PATIENT_NOT_FOUND` if the patient is not in the tenant.
}
